,"en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1048","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[30,17,70,76,82,77],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"99","reputation":"16400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1048","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[30,17,70,76,82,77],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"99","reputation":"16400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[30,17,70,76,82,77],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"99","reputation":"16400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1058","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[30,17,70,76,82,77],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"15200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[30,17,70,76,82,77],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1028305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国官臣、名士。出身显赫，少年时便因少修节操，容貌奇伟而闻名。其父张允曾任孙权东曹掾，掌管官吏选拔。孙权继位后加入东吴。赤壁前夕参与了诸葛亮发起的舌战群儒，被其说服。后刘备病逝，邓芝奉命出使吴国示好，张温负责出使蜀国答谢。，肩负修复吴蜀联盟的重任。张温在蜀汉表现卓越，与秦宓进行天辩，不仅以文采折服群臣，更与诸葛亮建立私谊。然而，却引发孙权猜忌。因支持好友暨艳改革吏治，清查不法权贵，废黜官职，遣还本郡，郁郁而终。","tc":"吳國官臣、名士。出身顯赫，少年時便因少修節操，容貌奇偉而聞名。其父張允曾任孫權東曹掾，掌管官吏選拔。孫權繼位后加入東吳。赤壁前夕參與了諸葛亮發起的舌戰群儒，被其說服。后劉備病逝，鄧芝奉命出使吳國示好，張溫負責出使蜀國答謝。，肩負修復吳蜀聯盟的重任。張溫在蜀漢表現卓越，與秦宓進行天辯，不僅以文采折服群臣，更與諸葛亮建立私誼。然而，卻引發孫權猜忌。因支持好友暨艷改革吏治，清查不法權貴，廢黜官職，遣還本郡，郁郁而終。","en":"An official and celebrated scholar of Eastern Wu. Born to an illustrious family, he was renowned in his youth for his rectitude and magnificent bearing. His father, Zhang Yun, had served as Sun Quan's Officer of the Eastern Bureau, overseeing civil appointments. Zhang Wen joined Eastern Wu after Sun Quan succeeded to the rule. On the eve of Red Cliffs, he participated in the debate that Zhuge Liang waged against the scholars and was swayed by him. Later, after Liu Bei passed away, Deng Zhi was sent as an envoy to Wu with overtures of goodwill, and Zhang Wen was tasked with leading an embassy to Shu in return, bearing the vital duty of repairing the Wu-Shu alliance. In Shu Han, Zhang Wen performed splendidly, he held the ‘Celestial Discourse’ with Qin Mi, impressing the court with his literary brilliance and forging a close personal bond with Zhuge Liang. This, however, provoked Sun Quan's suspicion. For supporting his good friend Ji Yan's civil service reforms and investigation of corrupt elites, he was stripped of his rank, sent back to his home commandery, and died in sorrow.","jp":"呉の臣、名士。名門の出身で、若くして「節操を修め、容貌奇偉」と称えられ名を馳せた。父の張允はかつて孫権の東曹掾を務め、官吏の選抜を司った。孫権が後を継いだ後に東呉へ出仕。赤壁の戦いの前夜、諸葛亮が仕掛けた舌戦群儒に加わるも説き伏せられた。後に劉備が病没し、鄧芝が命を受けて呉を訪れ友好を示すと、張温はその返礼として蜀への使節を務め、呉蜀同盟修復の重責を担った。蜀漢では卓越した働きを見せ、秦宓と「天の弁」を交わしてその文才で群臣を感服させただけでなく、諸葛亮とも私的な親交を結んだ。しかし、これが孫権の猜疑を招くことになる。親友の曁艶による官吏登用の改革や不法な権貴の糾弾を支持した廉で官職を剥奪されて本郡へ送還され、失意のうちに世を去った。","kr":"오나라의 관료이자 명사이다. 명문가 출신으로, 어려서부터 절조를 닦고 용모가 비범하여 일찍이 명성을 떨쳤다. 부친인 장윤은 손권의 동조연을 지내며 관리 선발을 관장했다. 손권이 뒤를 이은 후 동오에 출사했다. 적벽대전 직전 제갈량이 주도한 설전에 참여했으나 그에게 설득당했다. 훗날 유비가 병사하자 등지가 명을 받아 오나라에 사신으로 와 화친을 청했고, 장온은 답례 사절로서 촉나라에 파견되어 오·촉 동맹을 복원하는 중책을 맡았다. 장온은 촉한에서 탁월한 활약을 펼쳤는데, 진복과 '천변(하늘을 논함)'을 벌여 빼어난 문재로 뭇 신하들을 감복시켰을 뿐만 아니라 제갈량과도 사적인 친분을 쌓았다. 그러나 이는 도리어 손권의 시기와 의심을 사고 말았다. 이후 친구인 기염이 관리 제도를 개혁하고 불법을 저지른 권귀들을 척결하려 하자 이를 지지했다가, 관직을 박탈당하고 본군으로 쫓겨나 울화 속에서 쓸쓸히 생을 마감했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10420","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"温","nameTc":"溫","nameEn":"Wen","nameJp":"温","nameKr":"온","nameOther":"","word":"惠恕","wordTc":"惠恕","wordEn":"Huishu","wordJp":"恵恕","wordKr":"혜서","wordOther":"","icon":"张温","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"210","city":"CS1058","gender":"0","rule":"30","force":"17","wise":"70","politics":"76","charm":"82","will":"77","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"11","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"5/5/5/5/5/69/37/5","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1006105","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003705","warSoulPoint":"900","battleSoulPoint":"200","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1004108","strategy2":"1007401;1001515","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/1/0/2/1/2/0/0/2/2/0/1/4/2/2/4/1/2/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"78","loyalty":"0","reputation":"15200","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"193","show":"210","death":"231","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1016005","helmet":"WP1028305","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;16/1;19/1;29/1;43/1;23/0;31/2;42/1;38/0;8/1;12/0;41/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"吴国官臣、名士。出身显赫，少年时便因少修节